   "subject": "Sending outputs to other app/client (which is not a Shiny app)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">I have a R shiny webApp, that can import raster layers, analyze them and plotting the results in four different output types (raster-plot, text, graph-plot). Instead of plotting the results, I would like to &quot;send/export&quot; them as files (*.geotiff, *.txt or similar) to be used in a different WebApp (not R shiny). They should behave like outputs plotted within R shiny (reactivity: outputs should change every time, the inputs are changed; some sort of sessionID: multiple users should be able to create different outputs at the same time).</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Unfortunately, I have very little knowledge about HTML/CSS/JavaScript and the <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/#building-outputs\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(74,107,130)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/%23building-outputs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405162068000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Rgb5r1_iTj8mLClAZ7sX6\">Building Outputs</a> chapter of the otherwise great R Shiny Tutorial is kind of confusing to me.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\">Can someone post an easy example of how such an output function would look like and how the output can be used in other webapps(HTML/CSS/JavaScript)? Here is some example code:</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><b>server.R</b></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># Define server logic for random distribution application</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nshinyServer</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">function</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">input</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> output</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">{</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  data </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> reactive</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">  \r\n    inFile </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> input$example_layer </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\">#data import</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n    </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">is</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">null</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">inFile</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n      </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">return</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">NULL</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n    raster</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">file</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> raster</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">inFile$datapath</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\">#transform to raster</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  output$raster</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plot </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n    plot</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">())</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\">#plot raster data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\">#create histogram displaying frquency of values in raster dataset</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  output$hist</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plot </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n    values_test</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">getValues</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">stack</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">()))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> \r\n    hist</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">values_test</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> \r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># Generate a summary of the data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  output$summary </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> renderPrint</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n    summary</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">())</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># summary of the raster data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><b>ui.R:</b></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.804800033569336px\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">library</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">shiny</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\nshinyUI</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">pageWithSidebar</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># Application title</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  headerPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n  sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n    </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\">#Import new raster Layer</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n    fileInput</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;example_layer&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;Choose Raster Layer (ASCII)&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> multiple</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">FALSE</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> accept</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;asc&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:gray\"># Show a tabset that includes a plot, histogram and summary</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  mainPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n    tabsetPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n      tabPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Raster-Plot&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> plotOutput</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;raster.plot&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n      tabPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Histogram&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> plotOutput</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;hist.plot&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n      tabPanel</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Summary&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;summary&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> \r\n\r\n    </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thank you very much!</font></pre></pre></div>"
    ]
   ]
